# EDC BRI Vendor & SLA Management

Mission-critical internal app for a 3-year BRI EDC project: vendor management, logistic tracking (10% buffer stock), and real-time SLA monitoring to avoid financial penalties.

## Tech Stack

- Frontend: Next.js App Router, React, Tailwind CSS
- Backend: Node.js + Prisma ORM (preferred) or FastAPI
- Database: PostgreSQL
- UI: Shadcn UI + Lucide Icons; high-contrast, data-dense Operation Center dashboards with dark/light mode

## Non-negotiables

- Prefer modular, validated, well-documented code
- Never hardcode BRI business rules — use config files or DB models so SLA terms can change without code rewrites
- Validate all ticket/SLA inputs strictly
